 * IMPORTANT CONTEXT: searching random 12-word mnemonics covers a
 * space of ~2^128 (24-word: ~2^256) - astronomically larger than
 * even the already-infeasible 2^70 brute force this whole project's
 * puzzle target represents. This tool cannot find anything by random
 * search in any practical timeframe; it exists as a technical
 * exercise (validated, working code), not a viable search strategy.
 */

